-- ==============================================================================
-- kkhypr: Machine-Specific Device Overrides (device.lua.example)
-- Copy this file to ~/.config/hypr/device.lua to apply host-specific tweaks.
-- This file is gitignored and will not be overwritten by upstream updates.
-- ==============================================================================

